# Copy to `.dev.vars` for local development (`npx wrangler pages dev dist`).
# In production these are set as encrypted secrets on Cloudflare Pages:
#   npx wrangler pages secret put <NAME> --project-name=apextraining
# NEVER commit the real .dev.vars — it is gitignored.
#
# See the "API keys & environment" section of README.md for where to get each
# key and exactly what breaks without it. Only the first two are required.

# ── Required ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Signs the session JWTs. Generate with: openssl rand -base64 48
AUTH_SECRET=replace-with-a-long-random-string

# Comma-separated admin accounts. These emails get the admin role on every
# request; everyone else is forced back to a normal user.
ADMIN_EMAILS=you@example.com,teammate@example.com

# ── Optional ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Invite keys for trainer signup. Comma-separated; each entry is either a bare
# key or KEY:Name:email to reserve one for a specific person. Trainers who sign
# up with a beta key are comped for life and never see billing.
# BETA_KEYS=ACOACH-XXXXXXXX,ACOACH-YYYYYYYY,COACH-ZZZZZZZZ:Jane Doe:jane@example.com

# Transactional email (client invitations, session reminders) — resend.com
# RESEND_API_KEY=re_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# EMAIL_FROM=ApexCoach <onboarding@resend.dev>

# Food & nutrition lookup — https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/api-key-signup.html
# USDA_API_KEY=your-usda-key

# Exercise library with demo media (ExerciseDB via RapidAPI)
# EXERCISEDB_API_KEY=your-rapidapi-key

# Web push. Generate a pair with: npx web-push generate-vapid-keys
# VAPID_PUBLIC_KEY=your-public-key
# VAPID_PRIVATE_KEY=your-private-key
# VAPID_SUBJECT=mailto:you@example.com

# Trainer subscriptions — https://dashboard.stripe.com/apikeys
# Requires products/prices with the lookup keys listed in README.md, plus a
# webhook pointing at https://<your-domain>/api/stripe/webhook
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_xxxxxxxx
# STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_xxxxxxxx
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_xxxxxxxx

# Use Anthropic's API instead of the built-in Cloudflare Workers AI.
# When unset, the app falls back to Workers AI (free, no key required).
# LLM_API_KEY=sk-ant-xxxxxxxx
# LLM_MODEL=claude-sonnet-5
